   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Parts of an exposition",
     "texto": [
      "An argumentative exposition can begin with a **pernyataan pendapat**, develop the **argumen** and close with a **penegasan**.",
      "A concrete **bukti pendukung** helps you tell a reason apart from a mere claim."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Argument connectors",
     "texto": [
      "**Berdasarkan data** means \"according to the data\"; **dengan demikian** introduces a conclusion. In Indonesian, the verb does not change by person or tense, so the order and these connectors help you follow the argument."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
